The bot with the most points when the 40 turns end wins the map. Points come from three places. You can use one, two or all three. 


Kills 
Bring an enemy to 0 health. A kill pays +40 plus bonuses. 
Part of each kill waits on the floor as a tag. Walk over it to collect the rest. 
Cargo 
