Rules:
12x12, 4 bots in corners, base = 2x2 corner pocket with 2 exits. Walls random but 4-way rotational symmetric around centre. Seeded RNG only.
40 turns, simultaneous actions. Overtime turn>=32: all points x2, energy regen +10 (else +5).
HP 70, energy 50 max. Costs: move1 collect2 defend2 attack5 shoot6 scan8 ability10.
Move 8 dirs; into wall/bot = no move, energy spent; off board = illegal; two bots same cell = neither moves.
Attack adjacent (chebyshev 1) 16-24 dmg, lands even if target moves. Shoot straight line 4 cells, first bot, 10-14, after moves, walls block. Defend half damage.
Vision 3 cells (chebyshev) with line_clear; scan +3 next turn. Always visible: walls, core, pads, tags, marked bots (CORE carrier, CARGO>=60, LOUD = attacked/shot last turn, CROWN = top score).
Death: respawn 3 turns later at base, full hp/energy, cargo drops as pile, 2-turn spawn protection (ends if attack/shoot/collect/ability).
