Resources: 4 at start, supply waves of 4 (symmetric) on turns 10,18,26. Each value 10-20. Hold 4 units. Collect within 2 cells of enemy = x1.3. Bank by standing on base. Unbanked cargo at end = 0.
Core: spawns turn 8 at a centre cell. Collect it, step on one of 4 edge pads, plants. Survives 3 turns = +60. Enemy within 1 cell for 2 consecutive turn-ends = defused, +40 each adjacent enemy. Respawns 4 turns later.
Abilities (class attr ABILITY): DASH 2 cells straight, both free; SHIELD -70% this turn. Cooldown 6.
Role (class attr ROLE): HAULER = +1 hold, bank 3 units x1.25, 4+ x1.5, kills -10. None = default.
